# Protect Ukraine Now Mobile App Support

Welcome to Protect Ukraine Now Mobile App Support.

If you need assistance with the Protect Ukraine Now mobile application, have questions about your account, or experience technical difficulties, please contact our support team.

## Contact Support

For assistance, please email [support@protectukrainenow.org](mailto:support@protectukrainenow.org).

To help us assist you quickly, please describe your issue in as much detail as possible, including the steps that led to it.

## Account Deletion

You can delete your Protect Ukraine Now account directly from the mobile application:

1. Open the Protect Ukraine Now mobile application.
1. Navigate to your Profile.
1. Select the option to delete your account.
1. Follow the on-screen instructions to confirm the deletion.

If you experience any difficulties deleting your account, please contact [support@protectukrainenow.org](mailto:support@protectukrainenow.org).

